:["Folge uns"],"Delete %s?":["%s l\u00f6schen?"],"Are you sure you want to delete this channel?":["Bist du sicher, dass du diesen Kanal l\u00f6schen willst?"],"Your license key is inactive":["Dein Lizenzschl\u00fcssel ist inaktiv"],"No license key detected. Please activate your license key to enable Pro features.":["Es wurde kein Lizenzschl\u00fcssel gefunden. Bitte aktiviere deinen Lizenzschl\u00fcssel, um die Funktionen der Pro-Version zu aktivieren."],"Activate License Key":["Lizenzschl\u00fcssel aktivieren"],"Channel Title":["Kanal-Titel"],"Published":["Ver\u00f6ffentlicht"],"Drafts":["Entw\u00fcrfe"],"View All":["Alle anzeigen"],"Publish All":["Alle ver\u00f6ffentlichen"],"Delete All":["Alle l\u00f6schen"],"%s of %s":["%s von %s"],"No single videos found":["Keine einzelnen Videos gefunden"],"Couldn't find any videos to import.":["Ich konnte keine Videos zum Importieren finden."],"Import Videos":["Videos importieren"],"Generate WordPress posts from your YouTube channel. Enter the channel name or ID and the number of videos to import below and click \u201cImport\u201d.":["Erstelle WordPress-Beitr\u00e4ge aus deinem YouTube-Kanal. Gib unten den Kanalnamen oder die ID und die Anzahl der zu importierenden Videos ein und klicke auf \"Importieren\"."],"Channel Name or ID":["Kanal-Name oder ID"],"Enter Channel name or ID (for example: voxdotcom)":["Gib den Namen oder die ID des Kanals ein (zum Beispiel: voxdotcom)"],"Import":["Importieren"],"Importing \u2022 %s Videos Imported":["Importieren - %s Importierte Videos"],"Please go to <a href='%s'>Settings<\/a> and enter an API key to activate the importer tool.":["Bitte gehe auf <a href='%s'>Einstellungen<\/a> und gib einen API-Schl\u00fcssel ein, um das Importer-Tool zu aktivieren."],"View All Videos":["Alle Videos ansehen"],"Test Connection":["Verbindung testen"],"Connection successful":["Verbindung erfolgreich"],"Connection failed":["Verbindung fehlgeschlagen"],"View error":["Fehler anzeigen"],"<span>You are using Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider <a href='%s' target='_blank'>Upgrading to Pro<\/a><\/span>":["<span>Du verwendest die Lite-Version des Plugins - du brauchst keine Lizenz. Viel Spa\u00df! \ud83d\ude42 Um mehr Funktionen freizuschalten, erw\u00e4ge <a href='%s' target='_blank'>ein Upgrade auf Pro<\/a><\/span>"],"License Key":["Lizenzschl\u00fcssel"],"Your license key provides access to updates and support":["Dein Lizenzschl\u00fcssel bietet Zugriff auf Aktualisierungen und Support"],"Your <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> license is %s":["Deine <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> Lizenz ist %s"],"<em>Already purchased? Simply enter your license key below to activate YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>":["<em>Bereits gekauft? Gib einfach deinen Lizenzschl\u00fcssel unten ein, um YouTube Feeds Pro zu aktivieren.<\/em>"],"Enter License Key":["Lizenzschl\u00fcssel eingeben"],"Manage License":["Lizenz verwalten"],"Enter API Key":["API-Schl\u00fcssel eingeben"],"Connected YouTube Account":["Verbundenes YouTube-Konto"],"This account is used to display channel feeds. It will not affect playlist, favorites, search, livestreams or single videos stream.":["Dieses Konto wird verwendet, um Kanal-Feeds anzuzeigen. Es hat keinen Einfluss auf die Wiedergabeliste, die Favoriten, die Suche, die Livestreams oder den Stream einzelner Videos."],"Feed not working? ":["Funktioniert der Feed nicht? "],"Try Re-authenticating connected account":["Versuch, das verbundene Konto erneut zu authentifizieren"],"API Key":["API-Schl\u00fcssel"],"Preserve settings if plugin is removed":["Einstellungen beibehalten, wenn das Plugin entfernt wird"],"This will make sure that all of your feeds and settings are still saved even if the plugin is uninstalled":["So wird sichergestellt, dass alle Feeds und Einstellungen gespeichert bleiben, obwohl das Plugin deinstalliert wird"],"Import Feed Settings":["Feed-Einstellungen importieren"],"You will need a JSON file previously exported from the Feeds for YouTube Plugin":["Du brauchst eine JSON-Datei, die du zuvor aus dem Feeds f\u00fcr YouTube Plugin exportiert hast"],"Export Feed Settings":["Feed-Einstellungen exportieren"],"Select Feed":["Feed ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Export":["Exportieren"],"Export settings for one or more of your feeds":["Exportiere die Einstellungen f\u00fcr einen oder mehrere deiner Feeds"],"Custom Code":["Individueller Code"],"Caching":["Caching"],"1:00":["1:00"],"2:00":["2:00"],"3:00":["3:00"],"4:00":["4:00"],"5:00":["5:00"],"6:00":["6:00"],"7:00":["7:00"],"8:00":["8:00"],"9:00":["9:00"],"10:00":["10:00"],"11:00":["11:00"],"12:00":["12:00"],"Cache cleared successfully.":["Der Cache wurde erfolgreich gel\u00f6scht."],"Couldn't clear the cache.":["Ich konnte den Cache nicht l\u00f6schen."],"Clear All Caches":["Alle Caches l\u00f6schen"],"Used for showing views. Example: 392k views":["Wird f\u00fcr die Anzeige von Ansichten verwendet. Beispiel: 392k Ansichten"],"Ago":["Vor"],"Used for showing time. Example: 3d ago":["Wird zur Anzeige der Zeit verwendet. Beispiel: Vor 3d"],"Used to highlight when a video is streaming live":["Wird verwendet, um hervorzuheben, wenn ein Video live gestreamt wird"],"Used to highlight when a video is going to stream live":["Wird verwendet, um hervorzuheben, wann ein Video live gestreamt wird"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 3 minutes 21 seconds":["Wird verwendet, um die L\u00e4nge des Videos anzuzeigen. Beispiel: 3 Minuten 21 Sekunden"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 1 hour 3 minutes":["Zeigt die L\u00e4nge des Videos an. Beispiel: 1 Stunde 3 Minuten"],"To display the call to action":["So zeigst du den Aufruf zum Handeln an"],"Thousands":["Tausende"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 321K videos":["Wird in der Anzahl der Ansichten verwendet. Beispiel: 321K Videos"],"Millions":["Millionen"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 4.2M videos":["Wird in der Anzahl der Ansichten verwendet. Beispiel: 4.2M Videos"],"Custom Text\/Translate":["Benutzerdefinierter Text\/\u00dcbersetzung"],"Enter custom text for the words below, or translate it into the language you would like to use.":["Gib einen benutzerdefinierten Text f\u00fcr die W\u00f6rter unten ein oder \u00fcbersetze sie in die Sprache, die du verwenden m\u00f6chtest."],"Original Text":["Originaltext"],"Custom text\/translation":["Benutzerdefinierter Text\/\u00dcbersetzung"],"Context":["Kontext"],"AJAX theme loading fix":["Fehlerbehebung f\u00fcr Laden von AJAX-Themes"],"Usage Tracking":["Aufzeichnung des Nutzungsverhaltens"],"Cron Clear Cache":["Cron Cache l\u00f6schen"],"If your YouTube feed is not updating, your WordPress installation may have a rare issue with clearing temporary data in your database. Enable this setting to use WordPress cron to clear your feed caches.":["Wenn dein YouTube Feed nicht aktualisiert wird, kann es sein, dass deine WordPress-Installation ein seltenes Problem mit dem L\u00f6schen von tempor\u00e4ren Daten in deiner Datenbank hat. Aktiviere diese Einstellung, um den WordPress-Cron zum L\u00f6schen der Feed-Caches zu verwenden."],"Enqueue JavaScript in header":["JavaScript in der Kopfzeile einreihen"],"Add the JavaScript file for the plugin in the header instead of the footer":["F\u00fcge die JavaScript-Datei f\u00fcr das Plugin in die Kopfzeile statt in die Fu\u00dfzeile ein"],"Disable WP Posts":["WP-Beitr\u00e4ge deaktivieren"],"This will disable the feature that saves each video as a WordPress post.":["Dadurch wird die Funktion deaktiviert, mit der jedes Video als WordPress-Beitrag gespeichert wird."],"Save new videos as":["Neue Videos speichern als"],"Draft":["Entwurf"],"Publish":["Ver\u00f6ffentlichen"],"When you import new videos, they will be saved accordingly":["Wenn du neue Videos importierst, werden sie entsprechend gespeichert"],"Information to Display":["Anzuzeigende Informationen"],"Stats (Like and Comment Count)":["Statistiken (Anzahl der Likes und Kommentare)"],"Saved Featured Images":["Gespeicherte ausgew\u00e4hlte Bilder"],"Enabling this feature will automatically download video thumbnails and assign them as the featured image for a video post created using YouTube Feeds. Image files are stored in your WordPress media library.":["Wenn du diese Funktion aktivierst, werden automatisch Video-Thumbnails heruntergeladen und als Beitragsbild f\u00fcr einen mit YouTube Feeds erstellten Videobeitrag verwendet. Die Bilddateien werden in deiner WordPress-Mediathek gespeichert."],"Smash Balloon Team":["Team von Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Wir von Smash Balloon erstellen Software, mit der du in wenigen Minuten attraktive responsive Social-Media-Feeds f\u00fcr deine Website erstellen kannst."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Unser Ziel ist, das Hinzuf\u00fcgen von Social-Media-Feeds in WordPress zu vereinfachen. Keine komplizierten Einrichtungsschritte, keine h\u00e4sslichen iFrame-Widgets und keine schlechten Werte bei der Seitengeschwindigkeit mehr."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Unsere Plugins sind nicht nur einfach zu bedienen, sondern auch komplett anpassbar, zuverl\u00e4ssig und schnell! Deshalb haben sich mehr als 1,6 Millionen Benutzer wie du daf\u00fcr entschieden, sie auf ihrer Website zu verwenden."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Unsere anderen Social-Media-Feed-Plugins"],"Plugins we recommend":["Von uns empfohlene Plugins"],"Search Documentation":["Dokumentation durchsuchen"],"Need more support? We\u2019re here to help.":["Brauchst du mehr Unterst\u00fctzung? Wir sind f\u00fcr dich da."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Ein Support-Ticket einreichen"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Unser schnelles und freundliches Support-Team hilft dir immer gerne weiter!"],"System Info":["Systeminformation"],"Collapse":["Einklappen"],"Expand":["Ausklappen"],"Export Settings":["Exporteinstellungen"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Gib deine Plugin-Einstellungen einfach f\u00fcr den Support frei"],"Getting Started":["Erste Schritte"],"Some helpful resources to get you started":["Einige hilfreiche Ressourcen f\u00fcr den Anfang"],"More help getting started":["Mehr Hilfe zum Einstieg"],"Docs & Troubleshooting":["Dokumentation & Problembehandlung"],"Run into an issue? Check out our help docs.":["Bist du auf ein Problem gesto\u00dfen? Schau dir unsere Hilfe-Dokumente an."],"View Documentation":["Dokumentation anzeigen"],"Additional Resources":["Zus\u00e4tzliche Ressourcen"],"To help you get the most out of the plugin":["Damit du das Plugin optimal nutzen kannst"],"View Blog":["Blog anzeigen"],"Creating Your First YouTube Feed":[""],"How do I Find a Channel ID?":[""],"Guide to Creating and Using an API Key":[""],"How do I Embed a Feed Into a Template Directly?":[""],"My Feed is Showing Unlisted Videos":[""],"Can I Change When the Video Plays?":[""],"How Does the Plugin Optimize Page Load Time?":[""],"Troubleshooting 'YouTube Data API has not been used in project'":[""],"Will Feeds For YouTube Work with Caching Plugins?":[""],"Enter or Paste API Key":[""],"Learn more about how to create and add an API Key here":[""],"Connect with an Access Token":[""],"Reviews":[""],"WPChat":[""],"Install WPChat and connect with customers on WhatsApp, Messenger, Telegram & Instagram and more":[""],"WPConsent":[""],"Detect all the plugins that use cookies and sets a consent banner in just a few clicks. Works well with Smash Balloon plugins.":[""],"TikTok":[""],"Convert videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Recheck license":[""],"Congratulations! You have upgraded to Youtube Feed ":[""],"Please update the plugin by clicking the button on the right for changes to take effect":[""],"Update Plugin":[""],"The plugin will be updated to a newer version":[""],"You might want to backup your website before updating the plugin":[""],"Update Anyway":[""],"Entered API Key is invalid. You can double check the API Key or learn more about generating them <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>here<\/a>":[""],"API Key is used to fetch from the YouTube API, and is required for several features to work. <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>Learn more<\/a>":[""],"No requests will be made to third-party websites. To accommodate this, some features of the plugin will be limited.":[""],"The plugin will function as normal and load videos directly from YouTube.":[""],"detected":[""],"No GDPR consent plugin detected. Install a compatible <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/feeds-for-youtube-gdpr-compliance\/?youtube' target='_blank'>GDPR consent plugin<\/a>, or manually enable the setting to display a GDPR compliant version of the feed to all visitors.":[""],"Activate WPConsent":[""],"Install WPConsent":[""],"Activate WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Install WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Manage cookie and privacy preference features from a single place. Smash Balloon plugins work great with WPConsent.":[""],"Installing...":[""],"This helps us prevent plugin and theme conflicts by sending a report in the background once per week about your settings and relevant site stats. It does not send sensitive information like access tokens, email addresses, or user info. This will not affect your site performance as well. <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-feed\/docs\/usage-tracking\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=usage-tracking' target='_blank'>Learn More<\/a>":[""],"The default HTML for the feed can be replaced with custom templates added to your theme's folder. Enable this setting to use these templates. See <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/guide-to-creating-custom-templates\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=custom-templates' target='_blank'>this guide<\/a>.":[""],"Setup":[""],"Let us setup your plugin!":[""],"Bring the power of YouTube videos directly to your site! With an easy setup, you'll have your first feed ready to go in minutes.":[""],"Launch the Setup Wizard":[""],"Welcome Image":[""],"Step":[""],"Exit Setup":[""],"1":[""],"Set up YouTube plugin ":[""],"To be able to fetch your YouTube videos we need a YouTube API key or a connected YouTube account.":[""],"Skip this step":[""],"Add API Key":[""],"Create all feed types (playlist and live streams)":[""],"Display video statistics, comments, and more":[""],"Fetch complete video history":[""],"Learn how to get a YouTube API Key":[""],"OR":[""],"Connect a YouTube account":[""],"Display 20+ videos from any channel":[""],"Cannot fetch playlists, live streams etc.":[""],"Cannot display likes and comments":[""],"Cannot filter out private videos":[""],"Connect YouTube Account Manually":[""],"Cannot connect a YouTube account from the plugin? Generate an access token from our website in a click and paste it below.":[""],"Paste Access Token here":[""],"Access Token entered is not valid":[""],"Generate Access Token":[""],"Add an API Key for YouTube":[""],"For optimal performance, reliability, and to use all feed types and features you will want to enter an API key. It is free to create and only takes a few minutes.":[""],"API key entered is not valid":[""],"API Key added successfully!":[""],"Your access token is added and now you should be able to add any YouTube feeds. You can update and delete it from Settings.":[""],"Okay":[""],"2":[""],"Configure features":[""],"YouTube channel feeds":[""],"Create and edit YouTube feeds":[""],"Downtime Prevention":[""],"Automatically prevents any downtime by cleverly using cache storage":[""],"Video player":[""],"Social Feed Collection":[""],"Install Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok plugins":[""],"Installs Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok feeds plugins":[""],"Install Reviews Feed and display customer reviews and an overall rating from Google or Yelp.":[""],"Installs Reviews Feed Plugin":[""],"Installs WPChat Plugin":[""],"Pro Features":[""],"Display playlists, live streams and comments":[""],"Show custom playlists, your live streams and video comments":[""],"Show custom end of video action":[""],"Display a customised call to action when a video ends":[""],"Convert Videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Copy all of your videos into WordPress custom posts":[""],"You might also be interested in...":[""],"Enable your favorite features and disable the ones you don\u2019t need":[""],"Install Selected Plugins":[""],"Activate a GDPR plugin":[""],"Install a GDPR plugin":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by activating a plugin today.":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by installing a plugin today.":[""],"Activate Selected Plugin":[""],"Install Selected Plugin":[""],"WPConsent activated":[""],"WPConsent installed":[""],"Why should I install a GDPR plugin?":[""],"Legal Compliance":[""],"Ensure your website complies with GDPR and other privacy regulations.":[""],"Build Trust":[""],"Show visitors you respect their privacy with transparent cookie consent.":[""],"Easy Management":[""],"Simplify cookie consent and privacy compliance with automated tools.":[""],"Upgrade to Unlock playlists, livestreams, custom actions and much more":[""],"To unlock these features and much more, upgrade to Pro and enter your license key below.":[""],"Upgrade to YouTube Feed Pro":[""],"Upgrade today and ":[""],"(auto-applied at checkout)":[""],"Awesome. You are all set up!":[""],"Here\u2019s an overview of everything that is setup":[""],"Complete Setup Without Upgrading":[""],"Installing":[""],"We\u2019re more than just an Youtube plugin!":[""],"Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":[""]}}}